{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8451a2a19a085724e51bbb7fb0e66e81e50e56e87f9300b4b7149e001cf9111", "ja": "（昼のカラーインクバトルは大熱戦だった。この後は\nジュリアのグラビア撮影。気分を切り替えないとな！）", "zh": "（白天的彩色墨水大战打得非常激烈。接下来是茱莉亚的写真拍摄。得转换一下心情才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "31d2edd53dfbdde924d994c72e98a228e93c7d8b68f09cc2eb7b3a43b5fb62cf", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせ！\n悪いな、インクがなかなか落ちなくてさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等了！\n不好意思，身上的墨水怎么都洗不掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "11fb191337d9becb6ba1351fc956d033a03eb12a5aa2085028171ed034c04278", "ja": "着替えるのに手間取っちまった。\n撮影、もう始まる時間だよな？", "zh": "换衣服花了点时间。\n拍摄差不多要开始了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1003_p", "source_sha256": "932cec54b642bc141be44a0fa8fb53741dad4da5ac04d572c5edfe2d8792ceab", "ja": "ああ、ジュリア。あと少しで準備が終わるみたいだ。\n休む暇がなくて、すまないな。", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚。好像再过一会儿就准备好了。\n没时间休息，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "da8e364f5faecdfeb1390aea2251d6d7328127cd75e972995b47e328fbbd02ab", "ja": "あたしなら大丈夫だよ。さっきのバトルの影響か、\nまだ少しテンションが上がっててさ。", "zh": "我没事。可能是因为刚才那场战斗，我现在情绪还有点高涨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "c26027bbe0a5a7306c37cdb4641e4e4d487f1a6f6e5715d3de80649019f618dc", "ja": "しかし、めちゃくちゃ熱いバトルだったよなぁ。\nあんなに夢中で遊んだのは久しぶりだよ。", "zh": "不过，刚才那场对决真是太过火热了。\n像那样全情投入地玩，还是久违了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f1fa41b7580703ba722e621437dc1a480bd2ed9a3d1e89d79405f3e5c60f5853", "ja": "ジュリアが楽しかったみたいでよかった。\nでも、大丈夫か？　この後の撮影……。", "zh": "看来茱莉亚玩得很开心，太好了。\n不过，没事吧？接下来的拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "d8fb4ace9a51a50d1241c6b6dc00fad21c4644050839784b19407a3391001efc", "ja": "わかってるよ。神秘的で幻想的なイメージ、だろ？\n本番までには、なんとかするよ。", "zh": "我知道。神秘又梦幻的形象，对吧？\n正式拍摄前，我会想办法调整好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9e876ae0ebdab57d86ffdbe87262fb1351c397d7e438f04903f38d1176ef3eb7", "ja": "ああ、そうしてくれ。けど、意外だったな。\nジュリアがあんなに熱くなるなんて。", "zh": "啊，那就拜托你了。不过还真是出乎意料。\n没想到茱莉亚竟然会那么热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "6892766f631f84e0ed0b9673522c3d872e8f707a3edb2bb494a0ceaf6e3e75dc", "ja": "そうか？　小学生くらいの頃は、\n友達ともあんな感じでよく遊んでたけどな。", "zh": "是吗？我上小学那会儿，也经常和朋友们那样一起玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1010_p", "source_sha256": "84d1f107eb62d7c4827c69c84dcb6efa13a35babdc9e7e0fdd5b90715ef9203e", "ja": "どうりで……。指示を出したり、仲間を助けたり、\n活躍してたのも納得だ。", "zh": "难怪……你会下达指示、帮助伙伴，还表现得那么活跃，也就说得通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "fb7ae85d34f4814e08a068946d18f4e82f1d999b90dc846bace187bec359105a", "ja": "へへっ。……っと、もっと話したいとこだけど、\nそろそろ気持ちを切り替えないとな。", "zh": "嘿嘿。……不过，虽然还想再聊一会儿，也差不多该调整一下心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "792c02894ab7d841c642f155f02154f2792806b07216bc71e16eb4a67b3db62b", "ja": "神秘的で幻想的……ふぅ。……よしっ！\n夜までの長丁場だ、気合い入れていくぜっ！", "zh": "神秘而梦幻……呼。……好！\n要撑到晚上，得打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1013_p", "source_sha256": "be3044f7ba8c81acfcb414ef4055db9b60d18a12b6d1543852c066d6bbfcd49e", "ja": "夜まで……？\nいや、今日は夕方の撮影で終わりだぞ。", "zh": "到晚上……？\n没有，今天拍到傍晚就结束了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa3b61efeb363c0985c5c30164d8345f56a27fb09f9cec88e256311217a9029c", "ja": "は？　なに言ってんだよ。\n夜の海に入るシーンがあるだろ？", "zh": "哈？你在说什么啊。\n不是有在夜晚下海的场景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c1e3ef3b1d4083f08862eef2246964d1a494633a8eb2560fd54f440e3bee97dc", "ja": "あるけど……それは、別日にスタジオで撮るって、\n前に説明しなかったか？", "zh": "是有……不过，我之前不是说明过吗？那场戏要改天在摄影棚拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc9290f617bab5ab43a135c5c9c4ea8c684c1ef5b54fa87f67b881da869af15b", "ja": "聞いてない……と思う。いや、海で撮るんだなって、\n少し浮かれてたからな。聞き逃したかも？", "zh": "没听说过……吧。不是，我当时有点兴奋，以为要在海边拍，所以可能没听清？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "ae00037fde92ca074fa4f48b470424c90975c8d116ac9da31a414a98a8635acb", "ja": "どちらにしろ、あたしの勘違いじゃねーか！\nくぅ……。", "zh": "不管怎么说，不都是我误会了吗！\n呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b6358a1685eeae82af67bfcbb0867c318e0f9f276aef1821a9fa19a3047ae86d", "ja": "俺が伝え忘れてたかもしれないし……。\nでも、そうか。海、楽しみにしてたんだな！", "zh": "也可能是我忘了告诉你……不过这样啊，你一直很期待去海边呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2a9adea88ade249bac07c8a52671d8bcdd1c5bbcc78369451820f5c6d6f38b3", "ja": "なっ……た、楽しみにして悪いかよ！　あーもう！\nせっかく、気持ち切り替えようと思ったのに……。", "zh": "什……我、我期待一下海边不行吗！啊真是的！\n好不容易才想打起精神来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "b521544c3eda2f2f752bb8af99c551b34ba13ec81124b3a0bb72e9eb103640c5", "ja": "こうなったのも、全部あんたのせいだからな！\n責任とって……気分転換、付き合ってくれよな？", "zh": "事情变成这样，全都是你的错啊！\n所以你得负起责任……陪我散散心，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0344_1021_p", "source_sha256": "85fda6a537ce2f900a529956b43e20fc26598c2384926deebfa7569bea6780d3", "ja": "（その後、本番までジュリアと周辺を散歩した。\nその甲斐もあり、いい写真が出来上がった！）", "zh": "（之后，在正式演出前，我和茱莉亚在附近散了散步。多亏如此，拍出了很棒的照片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
